-- title:
--   At good level (varpi) is prime, not maximal, in the j-finite chart
-- statement:
--   Let $p$ be a prime and $N$ a nonzero natural number with $5 \le N$ and $p \nmid N$. Let $L$ be a field of characteristic zero that is a $\{p\}$-cyclotomic extension of $\mathbb{Q}$, and let $\zeta \in L$ be a primitive $p$-th root of unity. Let $K$ be an intermediate field of $L \subseteq \mathrm{LaurentSeries}\,L$ which equals [`ModularCurve.laurentBaseChange L (ModularCurve.x1FunctionField N)`](def/ModularCurve_LaurentCoeff.html#L103), i.e. the $L$-subfield of $L$-Laurent series generated by the image, under the coefficientwise map $\mathrm{LaurentSeries}\,\mathbb{Q} \to \mathrm{LaurentSeries}\,L$ induced by $\mathbb{Q} \to L$, of the $q$-expansion function field of $\Gamma_1(N)$ over $\mathbb{Q}$. Let $A$ be a discrete valuation domain with fraction field $L$ such that $p$ lies in the maximal ideal of $A$ and $\zeta$ lies in the image of $A \to L$, with an $A$-algebra structure on $K$ compatible with the tower $A \to L \to K$. Let $j \in K$ be nonzero and have as underlying Laurent series the image under that coefficientwise map of the $q$-expansion [`ModularCurve.jq`](def/ModularCurve_X0.html#L157) of the modular $j$-invariant, and let $\varpi$ generate the maximal ideal of $A$. Then, inside the $A$-subalgebra `chartAlgFin A K j` of $K$ consisting of the elements of $K$ integral over the $A$-subalgebra generated by $j$, the ideal generated by the image of $\varpi$ is prime and is not maximal.
--
--   Equivalently, the quotient of the $j$-finite chart of the two-chart integral model of $X_1(N)$ over $A$ by a uniformiser is a domain which is not a field: at good level ($p \nmid N$, $N \ge 5$) the special fibre of that chart is an integral curve rather than a point. The statement is used in the finiteness and flatness properties of the $j$-finite chart at raised level and in the identification of elements of the chart lying in the maximal ideal of the Gauss valuation subring.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_XOne_isDomain_quotient_span_and_not_isMaximal_chartAlgFin_twoChartIntegralModel_x1.lean

import Mathlib
